[
  {
    "id": "7a0e0000000000a0",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "SAP trial - travel agency",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Runs against an SAP ABAP Cloud Developer Trial (Docker image sapse/abap-cloud-developer-trial).\n\n1. Open the 'SAP trial' connection: Host URL (http://localhost:50000 when Node-RED runs on the same machine), SAP client 001, user DEVELOPER and its password.\n2. Deploy.\n3. Press the buttons from top to bottom: list, create, book, change, read, delete.\n\nThe travel agency is SAP's Flight reference scenario (/DMO/TRAVEL_U, OData V4); the last flow reads the EPM sales orders (GWSAMPLE_BASIC, OData V2). The created travel id is kept in the flow context (travelId)."
  },
  {
    "id": "7a0e0000000000c0",
    "type": "sap-connection",
    "name": "SAP trial",
    "url": "http://localhost:50000",
    "client": "001",
    "language": "EN",
    "authType": "basic",
    "proxyMode": "none",
    "rejectUnauthorized": true,
    "timeout": 60000,
    "metadataTtl": 3600
  },
  {
    "id": "7a0e000000000101",
